OL,5,G2200 Kate: Our New Diana?
OL,6,     FThis programme compares and
OL,7,     Fcontrasts the life and style of
OL,8,     Ftwo Princesses of Wales: Kate and
OL,9,     FDiana, exploring Diana's legacy,
OL,10,     Fwhich benefits the new generation
OL,11,     Fof royals, and their fashion.
OL,12,G2300 Taggart
OL,13,     FDI Robbie Ross joins the team to
OL,14,     Finvestigate a murder at an army
OL,15,     Fcamp. It seems the killing is
OL,16,     Flinked to a racehorse scam and
OL,17,     Fsomeone is out for revenge...
